  "intuition": "Simplified and stabilized the original design by removing unnecessary mixture of scales and redundant margin manipulations. Use the pairwise margin difference directly from cost_gap to maintain semantic relevance. Clamp the logits to [-20, 20] to prevent numerical instability when applying logsigmoid. Keep weighting optional and mean aggregation intact. This preserves pairwise margin and control over gradient smoothness while ensuring numerical stability and clarity.",
